"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/product\/trading-for-para-starts-september-7-deposit-now","title":{"rendered":"Trading for PARA Starts September 7 &#8211; Deposit Now!"},"content":{"rendered":"<p><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"15341\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/blog-inner-single-token-18\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/09\/Blog-Inner-Single-token.png?fit=4608%2C2100&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"4608,2100\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"Blog Inner &amp;#8211; Single token\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/09\/Blog-Inner-Single-token.png?fit=1024%2C467&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"aligncenter wp-image-15341 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/09\/Blog-Inner-Single-token.png?resize=4608%2C2100&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"4608\" height=\"2100\" srcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/09\/Blog-Inner-Single-token.png?w=4608&amp;ssl=1 4608w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/09\/Blog-Inner-Single-token.png?resize=300%2C137&amp;ssl=1 300w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/09\/Blog-Inner-Single-token.png?resize=1024%2C467&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/09\/Blog-Inner-Single-token.png?resize=768%2C350&amp;ssl=1 768w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/09\/Blog-Inner-Single-token.png?resize=1536%2C700&amp;ssl=1 1536w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/09\/Blog-Inner-Single-token.png?resize=2048%2C933&amp;ssl=1 2048w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/09\/Blog-Inner-Single-token.png?resize=200%2C91&amp;ssl=1 200w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/09\/Blog-Inner-Single-token.png?w=3000&amp;ssl=1 3000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" \/><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">We\u2019re thrilled to announce that <a href=\"https:\/\/www.kraken.com\/prices\/parallel-finance\">Parallel Finance (PARA)<\/a> starts trading on Kraken today!<\/span><\/p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Funding and trading<\/span><\/h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Add PARA to your Kraken account by navigating to <\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/www.kraken.com\/u\/funding\"><b>Funding<\/b><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, selecting <\/span><b>Parallel Finance<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, and then <\/span><b>Deposit<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">. Trading begins September <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">7<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Here\u2019s what you need to know:<\/span><\/p>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Ticker<\/b><\/td>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">PARA<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Tradable against<\/b><\/td>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">EUR, USD<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Price precision<\/b><\/td>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">1 decimal places<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Minimum Order Size<\/b><\/td>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">500<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Minimum Deposit<\/b><\/td>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">50<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Deposit confirmations required<\/b><\/td>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">25 confirmations (6 minutes)<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Not available in<\/b><\/td>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">United States, Canada, Japan<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Services available<\/b><\/td>\n<td><a href=\"https:\/\/www.kraken.com\/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Kraken<\/span><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, <\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/trade.kraken.com\/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Kraken Pro<\/span><\/a><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Keep an eye on our <\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/status.kraken.com\/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">status page<\/span><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> for updates.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><b>Note:<\/b><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li aria-level=\"1\"><b>Trading via the Kraken app and instant buy will be available once liquidity conditions are met<\/b><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> (when a sufficient number of buyers and sellers have entered the market and orders can be efficiently matched)<\/span><\/i><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3><b>What is Parallel Finance (PARA)?<\/b><\/h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Parallel Finance is a DeFi ecosystem launched on the <a href=\"https:\/\/www.kraken.com\/prices\/polkadot\">Polkadot<\/a> and <a href=\"https:\/\/www.kraken.com\/prices\/kusama\">Kusama<\/a> networks. The platform features a suite of interoperable decentralized applications (dApps) and derivative tokens that allow users to borrow, lend, swap and earn yield on cross-chain assets. PARA is the native token of the project used to pay transaction fees on the platform, incentivize validators to help secure the network, earn rewards via staking and vote on decisions that affect the future direction of the protocol.<\/span><\/p>\n<h3><b>Will Kraken make more assets available?<\/b><\/h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Yes! But our policy is to never reveal any details until shortly before launch \u2013 including which assets we are considering. All of Kraken\u2019s available tokens can be found <\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/support.kraken.com\/hc\/en-us\/articles\/360000678446-Cryptocurrencies-available-on-Kraken\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">here<\/span><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, and all future tokens will be announced on Kraken\u2019s blog and social media profiles. Our client engagement specialists cannot answer any questions about which assets we may be making available in the future.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<h3><b>Trade with caution<\/b><\/h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">There is no guarantee that a limit order will execute. There is also no guarantee a market order will execute at a certain price. The availability and liquidity of the particular digital asset will impact these types of orders.<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/>\n<\/span><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<p><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">These materials are for general information purposes only and are not investment advice or a recommendation or solicitation to buy, sell or hold any digital asset or to engage in any specific trading strategy. Some crypto products and markets are unregulated, and you may not be protected by government compensation and\/or regulatory protection schemes. The unpredictable nature of the cryptoasset markets can lead to loss of funds. Tax may be payable on any return and\/or on any increase in the value of your cryptoassets and you should seek independent advice on your taxation position.<\/span><\/i><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>We\u2019re thrilled to announce that Parallel Finance (PARA) starts trading on Kraken today! Funding and trading Add PARA to your Kraken account by navigating to Funding, selecting Parallel Finance, and then Deposit. Trading begins September 7. Here\u2019s what you need to know: Ticker PARA Tradable against EUR, USD Price precision 1 decimal places Minimum Order [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":120066484,"featured_media":15342,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_jetpack_newsletter_access":"","_jetpack_dont_email_post_to_subs":false,"_jetpack_newsletter_tier_id":0,"_jetpack_memberships_contains_paywalled_content":false,"_wpcom_ai_launchpad_first_post":false,"_jetpack_feature_clip_id":0,"_jetpack_memberships_contains_paid_content":false,"footnotes":"","jetpack_post_was_ever_published":false},"categories":[1789,1426],"tags":[1377],"language":[],"class_list":["post-15335","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-asset-listings","category-product","tag-para"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO Premium plugin v23.2 (Yoast SEO v28.5) - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-premium-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>Trading for PARA Starts September 7 - Deposit Now! - Kraken Blog<\/title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/product\/trading-for-para-starts-september-7-deposit-now\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Trading for PARA Starts September 7 - Deposit Now!\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"We\u2019re thrilled to announce that Parallel Finance (PARA) starts trading on Kraken today! Funding and trading Add PARA to your Kraken account by navigating to Funding, selecting Parallel Finance, and then Deposit. Trading begins September 7. Here\u2019s what you need to know: Ticker PARA Tradable against EUR, USD Price precision 1 decimal places Minimum Order [&hellip;]\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/product\/trading-for-para-starts-september-7-deposit-now\" \/>\n<m